# Stage-2 / pgphoto binary region for issue #251

This directory holds the provenance-pinned ARM binary region needed by
issue #15 (ARM user-space emulation for executable Stage-2 lifecycle tests)
and consumed by patcher issue #251.

## Status

**NOT CHECKED IN** — The actual binary region from the v90-era
`capture_image_with_Bulb` capture lifecycle was extracted read-only during
review but deliberately not checked in to this repository. Redistribution of
the blob is a decision for this repo, not an assumption to inherit.

